	quests: [
		{
			title: "The Final Key"
			x: -1.5d
			y: 0.0d
			shape: "pentagon"
			description: [
				"&5The final dimension, Bandit."
				""
				"&dNearly there. It won't be easy."
				""
				"&5Though probably good to mention just beating the last of the Board of Directors isn't an instant win..."
				""
				"&dYou'll still be stuck there. Which isn't acceptable. "
				""
				"&5But the key to getting you out requires beating the last Boss and getting his Boss Card."
				""
				"&dAnd you'll need to get there. The Realmstone for the Shyrelands requires visiting a few different dimensions..."
				""
				"&5Darkly Powder from Dustopia, Bloodstone from Abyss..."
				""
				"&dHaunted Flower from Greckon, and some Magic Mending Solution..."
			]
			dependencies: ["6C161565C1C22C32"]
			id: "33ED1292B70F45B2"
			tasks: [{
				id: "55C33C10C600544A"
				type: "checkmark"
			}]
		}
		{
			title: "There and Back"
			x: 0.5d
			y: 0.0d
			shape: "pentagon"
			description: [
				"&5When crafting the Shyrelands Realmstone, keep in mind you'll want to make the Magic Mending Solution last."
				""
				"&dIt will transform into a Compound thirty seconds after you mix it, so you'll need to have everything on hand and ready."
				""
				"&5If you are forgetting how to get Magic Dust for the Magic Mending Solution, every creature in Advent of Ascension has a tiny chance of dropping it."
				""
				"&dBut the bosses have a much higher chance. You can also find it in various castles across the dimensions."
			]
			dependencies: ["33ED1292B70F45B2"]
			id: "1C425F7E27B7C144"
			tasks: [{
				id: "493B67AE93170AFE"
				type: "item"
				item: "aoa3:shyrelands_realmstone"
			}]
			rewards: [{
				id: "0276A7835E1CEA87"
				type: "choice"
				table_id: 818089594093312426L
			}]
		}
		{
			title: "To the Shyre"
			x: 2.5d
			y: 0.0d
			shape: "pentagon"
			description: [
				"&5This is the Shyrelands, Bandit. The final bastion of the FOP Board of Directors."
				""
				"&dThe Board Chairman resides here, with his retinue of followers. At first this place looks fairly peaceful and pretty."
				""
				"&5But that facade fades quickly. You can see it in the deadliness of the various creatures that follow the Chairman. The ruins and whats left of the original inhabitants of the Shyre."
				""
				"&dThis place is given a very idylic coating of paint to look good. Maybe we can return it to that state for real. "
				""
				"&5With Bandit's help? Of course we can. Best not to dally, they don't take kindly to Power User intruders."
			]
			dependencies: ["1C425F7E27B7C144"]
			id: "5D2C07336322C609"
			tasks: [{
				id: "6A399854E162BE49"
				type: "dimension"
				dimension: "aoa3:shyrelands"
			}]
			rewards: [{
				id: "36C10D795A3553F6"
				type: "choice"
				table_id: 818089594093312426L
			}]
		}
		{
			title: "Shyre Supplies"
			x: 5.0d
			y: 0.0d
			shape: "hexagon"
			description: [
				"&5The Shyrelands is home to a lot of magical power. More than Runandor for sure. It has two powerful Ores beneath its grass you can mine."
				""
				"&dYou don't even have to go super low for it. See, Shyrelands is a giant slab of land, supported over the Void by grand pillars of magic."
				""
				"&5If you go low enough, you'll break through the crust into open air. You can see the many pillars that hold the land up."
				""
				"&dWhat may be a little harder to find is called Whitewashing Solution. It's what the Chairman's minions use to try keeping the world visually pristine."
				""
				"&5It cleans the toughest grease and poisons the strongest invader. Be careful of those who carry it, but you can probably use it yourself for some powerful gear."
			]
			dependencies: ["5D2C07336322C609"]
			id: "76F854D094600D5F"
			tasks: [
				{
					id: "0461D1AA34D38C0A"
