		{
			x: 8.0d
			y: 0.0d
			shape: "pentagon"
			description: [
				"&5The boss of the FOP Game Server, the Chairman of the Board of Directors, is a dangerous, deadly being known as Craexxeus."
				""
				"&dHe normally does not grant audiences with Power Users, instead just sending his minions in until the Power User is removed. "
				""
				"&5He has, however, forgotten about the original inhabitants of the Shyrelands. They have a way to call a Board Meeting."
				""
				"&dThey've hidden it as an item called an Ancient Ring. If you befriend the Shyre Archer merchants enough, they may be willing to trade it to you."
			]
			dependencies: ["76F854D094600D5F"]
			id: "3EC0E364CE73175C"
