			shape: "pentagon"
			description: [
				"&5Once you obtain an Ancient Ring, you'll need to prepare. "
				""
				"&dCraexxeus is the boss of the FOP Game Server for a reason. He's quite powerful, and flies and fights on a very dangerous creature."
				""
				"&5If you think you are ready, you'll need to find a Crae Statue, an homage to his powerful mount. You'll find a Craexxeus Altar in the mouth, and Right Clicking the Ancient Ring on it will call a Board Meeting, summoning Craexxeus."
			]
