		{
			title: "Upgrades of the Divine"
			x: 3.75d
			y: -4.0d
			shape: "rsquare"
			description: [
				"&dThe Divine Station is a special crafting bench you can  obtain from Divine Ritual Temples, a rare structure in the Shyrelands."
				""
				"&dWith this station, you can combine certain Weapons with certain Upgrade Kits to get a much more powerful weapon."
				""
				"&dThere are so many combinations, I'm going to set up a new page in your Q.U.E.S.T. book just for Divine Station upgrades, Bandit. I'll let ByteSize do the research and explain the upgrades to you."
				""
				"&dCheck out the new section in the Survive, Live, Profit area of the Q.U.E.S.T. Book."
			]
			dependencies: ["77A866B813FB0EC5"]
			id: "7E44C96E66017AD0"
