		{
			title: "The Board is Disbanded"
			x: 15.0d
			y: 0.0d
			shape: "hexagon"
			description: [
				"&5Great work, Bandit! That's the entire Board of Directors down!"
				""
				"&dYou should have collected one card from every Boss, whether you Fought or Bribed them."
				""
				"&5Now then, this doesn't mean that the FOP is done for. They still hold their Boss positions, and the FOP Game Server is still in their control."
				""
				"&dBut with the Boss Cards, and the constant spreading of the Aubodon Worm into their system, we've opened up the path to getting control of the FOP Game Server."
				""
				"&5And with control, we can rescue these trapped planets, and more importantly..."
				""
				"&dGet you home."
			]
			dependencies: [
				"61FC27DC9F62D458"
				"109859AE2E8D0E7C"
			]
